{"page":216,"verses":[{"verse_key":"10:62","surah":10,"ayah":62,"ar_uthmani":"أَلَآ إِنَّ أَوْلِيَآءَ ٱللَّهِ لَا خَوْفٌ عَلَيْهِمْ وَلَا هُمْ يَحْزَنُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"But for those who are on God’s side there is no fear, nor shall they grieve.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أَلَآ","en_gloss":"No doubt","transliteration":"alā","verse_key":"10:62"},{"pos":2,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"10:62"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَوْلِيَآءَ","en_gloss":"(the) friends","transliteration":"awliyāa","verse_key":"10:62"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"(of) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"10:62"},{"pos":5,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"(there will be) no","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"10:62"},{"pos":6,"ar":"خَوْفٌ","en_gloss":"fear","transliteration":"khawfun","verse_key":"10:62"},{"pos":7,"ar":"عَلَيْهِمْ","en_gloss":"upon then","transliteration":"ʿalayhim","verse_key":"10:62"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"10:62"},{"pos":9,"ar":"هُمْ","en_gloss":"they","transliteration":"hum","verse_key":"10:62"},{"pos":10,"ar":"يَحْزَنُونَ","en_gloss":"will grieve","transliteration":"yaḥzanūna","verse_key":"10:62"},{"pos":11,"ar":"٦٢","en_gloss":"(62)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"10:62"}]},{"verse_key":"10:63","surah":10,"ayah":63,"ar_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ وَكَانُوا۟ يَتَّقُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"For those who believe and are conscious of God,","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"Those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"10:63"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ءَامَنُوا۟","en_gloss":"believe","transliteration":"āmanū","verse_key":"10:63"},{"pos":3,"ar":"وَكَانُوا۟","en_gloss":"and are","transliteration":"wakānū","verse_key":"10:63"},{"pos":4,"ar":"يَتَّقُونَ","en_gloss":"conscious (of Allah)","transliteration":"yattaqūna","verse_key":"10:63"},{"pos":5,"ar":"٦٣","en_gloss":"(63)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"10:63"}]},{"verse_key":"10:64","surah":10,"ayah":64,"ar_uthmani":"لَهُمُ ٱلْبُشْرَىٰ فِى ٱلْحَيَوٰةِ ٱلدُّنْيَا وَفِى ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ ۚ لَا تَبْدِيلَ لِكَلِمَـٰتِ ٱللَّهِ ۚ ذَٰلِكَ هُوَ ٱلْفَوْزُ ٱلْعَظِيمُ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"for them there is good news in this life and in the Hereafter- there is no changing the promises of God- that is truly the supreme triumph.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"لَهُمُ","en_gloss":"For them","transliteration":"lahumu","verse_key":"10:64"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلْبُشْرَىٰ","en_gloss":"(are) the glad tidings","transliteration":"l-bush'rā","verse_key":"10:64"},{"pos":3,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"10:64"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلْحَيَوٰةِ","en_gloss":"the life","transliteration":"l-ḥayati","verse_key":"10:64"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلدُّنْيَا","en_gloss":"(of) the world","transliteration":"l-dun'yā","verse_key":"10:64"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَفِى","en_gloss":"and in","transliteration":"wafī","verse_key":"10:64"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ ۚ","en_gloss":"the Hereafter","transliteration":"l-ākhirati","verse_key":"10:64"},{"pos":8,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"No","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"10:64"},{"pos":9,"ar":"تَبْدِيلَ","en_gloss":"change","transliteration":"tabdīla","verse_key":"10:64"},{"pos":10,"ar":"لِكَلِمَـٰتِ","en_gloss":"(is there) in the Words","transliteration":"likalimāti","verse_key":"10:64"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ ۚ","en_gloss":"(of) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"10:64"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ذَٰلِكَ","en_gloss":"That","transliteration":"dhālika","verse_key":"10:64"},{"pos":13,"ar":"هُوَ","en_gloss":"is","transliteration":"huwa","verse_key":"10:64"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ٱلْفَوْزُ","en_gloss":"the success","transliteration":"l-fawzu","verse_key":"10:64"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ٱلْعَظِيمُ","en_gloss":"the great","transliteration":"l-ʿaẓīmu","verse_key":"10:64"},{"pos":16,"ar":"٦٤","en_gloss":"(64)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"10:64"}]},{"verse_key":"10:65","surah":10,"ayah":65,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَا يَحْزُنكَ قَوْلُهُمْ ۘ إِنَّ ٱلْعِزَّةَ لِلَّهِ جَمِيعًا ۚ هُوَ ٱلسَّمِيعُ ٱلْعَلِيمُ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Do not let their words grieve you [Prophet]. Power belongs entirely to God; He hears all and knows all;","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"And (let) not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"10:65"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَحْزُنكَ","en_gloss":"grieve you","transliteration":"yaḥzunka","verse_key":"10:65"},{"pos":3,"ar":"قَوْلُهُمْ ۘ","en_gloss":"their speech","transliteration":"qawluhum","verse_key":"10:65"},{"pos":4,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"10:65"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلْعِزَّةَ","en_gloss":"the honor","transliteration":"l-ʿizata","verse_key":"10:65"},{"pos":6,"ar":"لِلَّهِ","en_gloss":"(belongs) to Allah","transliteration":"lillahi","verse_key":"10:65"},{"pos":7,"ar":"جَمِيعًا ۚ","en_gloss":"all","transliteration":"jamīʿan","verse_key":"10:65"},{"pos":8,"ar":"هُوَ","en_gloss":"He","transliteration":"huwa","verse_key":"10:65"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلسَّمِيعُ","en_gloss":"(is) the All-Hearer","transliteration":"l-samīʿu","verse_key":"10:65"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلْعَلِيمُ","en_gloss":"the All-Knower","transliteration":"l-ʿalīmu","verse_key":"10:65"},{"pos":11,"ar":"٦٥","en_gloss":"(65)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"10:65"}]},{"verse_key":"10:66","surah":10,"ayah":66,"ar_uthmani":"أَلَآ إِنَّ لِلَّهِ مَن فِى ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ وَمَن فِى ٱلْأَرْضِ ۗ وَمَا يَتَّبِعُ ٱلَّذِينَ يَدْعُونَ مِن دُونِ ٱللَّهِ شُرَكَآءَ ۚ إِن يَتَّبِعُونَ إِلَّا ٱلظَّنَّ وَإِنْ هُمْ إِلَّا يَخْرُصُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"indeed, all who are in the heavens and on the earth belong to Him. Those who call upon others beside God are not really following partner-gods; they are only following assumptions and telling lies.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أَلَآ","en_gloss":"No doubt","transliteration":"alā","verse_key":"10:66"},{"pos":2,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"10:66"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لِلَّهِ","en_gloss":"to Allah (belongs)","transliteration":"lillahi